extras/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/a4c4fb87473c077d6a4f6f84136f777f.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/a4c4fb87473c077d6a4f6f84136f777f.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/babdbbda42d1872fd3402095338af8c2.poster.avif?t=1787435399\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/babdbbda42d1872fd3402095338af8c2.webm?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/babdbbda42d1872fd3402095338af8c2.mp4?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thirty fully realized characters live here, each with their own looks, routines, and over two months of daily chats. Take on their quests, learn their stories, and help with the problems a newly free society still has to solve. Out here, you are what you do for others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/1c4b4b4c862a7f9fc4a23661bea44d80.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/1c4b4b4c862a7f9fc4a23661bea44d80.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/c8ab770348c5805ec1b693717bb79c6d.poster.avif?t=1787435399\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/c8ab770348c5805ec1b693717bb79c6d.webm?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/c8ab770348c5805ec1b693717bb79c6d.mp4?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Derelict ruins are full of damaged furniture, clothing, and tools that the corporations left behind. Find them, repair them, and decide what happens next: keep a piece for your ship, gift it to a friend, or donate it to the common cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/3a513bd2f0c66436c356053672a8122a.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/3a513bd2f0c66436c356053672a8122a.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/0a83a235e880e0a7b004fd5c6357f3a2.poster.avif?t=1787435399\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/0a83a235e880e0a7b004fd5c6357f3a2.webm?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/0a83a235e880e0a7b004fd5c6357f3a2.mp4?t=1787435399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jovian space is wide open: fantastical moonlets, derelict ruins, and converted stations, each a short flight from your front door. Chart your own course, scan for new sites, and follow a rumor to see where it leads. Out here, space is big and weird but never frightening, and there is always somewhere new to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/8daff0473e8b3daec3b2171786add1ae.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/8daff0473e8b3daec3b2171786add1ae.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 FULLY REALIZED CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each with unique looks, behaviors and over 2 months of unique daily chats. Learn their stories, and help with the many problems faced by the people of Jupiter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR SHIP IS YOUR HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your spaceship with 80+ discoverable recipes and items. Paint the walls, stack your shelves, and take your cozy nest with you on every adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR PERFECT LOOK</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter any aspect of your look during play: character creation is only the beginning. Recolor clothing to match your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THAT'S NOT JUNK, IT'S TREASURE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and repair damaged furniture, clothing and tools. Use them yourself, gift them, or donate them to the common cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GROW AND THRIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools to perform harder jobs. Improve and expand your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OPEN WORLD EXPLORATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your ship to fantastical moonlets, derelict ruins, and converted space stations on your journey through a newly-reclaimed region of Jovian space. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACE IS BEAUTIFUL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a dynamic fully-composed soundtrack, gorgeous colorful visuals, and deep, characterful writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER CO-OP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless drop-in co-op. Keep your personal progression across sessions. Experience storylines together, or keep them for your own time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.avif?t=1787435399\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/extras_big/efa302cf8779a178089d6e8a148d74ac.webp?t=1787435399 width=1560 height=79 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Build a home on your own spaceship and take it adventuring across a newly liberated Jupiter. A cozy 1-4 player narrative life sim where you explore, salvage, and repair to help a huge cast of lovable characters make society better.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/4715f86de42a873d8a788004fe032ad7617141d9/header.jpg?t=1787435399", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/82265c0cc8064e47b34b1a278ed264d2312ab797/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787435399", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149610/82265c0cc8064e47b34b1a278ed264d2312ab797/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787435399", "website": "https://www.youngsuns.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100/AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX950/ASUS R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadban